<title>THAILAND: Thoresen Thai Q2 turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Thoresen Thai Q2 turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997			   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)   loss    1.74   vs	profit    2.03</p>
<p>    Net	    loss   65.20   vs	profit   60.87</p>
<p>				 Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)   loss    3.42   vs	profit    4.02</p>
<p>    Net	    loss  128.12   vs	profit  120.52</p>
<p>Notes: Results are reviewed. Thoresen Thai Agencies Plc is a shipping company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
